#: apps/reporting/forms.py
msgid "Severity"
msgstr "Gravedad"

#: apps/reporting/forms.py
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "Atención"

#: apps/reporting/forms.py
msgid "Heading"
msgstr "Encabezado"

#: apps/reporting/forms.py
msgid "Finding"
msgstr "Hallazgo"

#: templates/reporting/narrative_form.html
msgid "Findings"
msgstr "Hallazgos"

#: apps/reporting/forms.py
msgid "Note for the period"
msgstr "Observación del período"

#: apps/reporting/forms.py
msgid ""
"Shown on the permits page. Leave it empty and the report says the note is "
"pending, never that there is nothing to say."
msgstr ""
"Se muestra en la página de permisos. Si queda vacía, el informe dice que la "
"observación está pendiente, nunca que no hay nada que decir."

#: apps/reporting/forms.py
msgid "Leave no empty finding between two written ones."
msgstr "No deje un hallazgo vacío entre dos escritos."

#: apps/reporting/models.py
msgid "Findings must be a list."
msgstr "Los hallazgos deben ser una lista."

#: apps/reporting/models.py
msgid "Each finding needs a severity, title and text."
msgstr "Cada hallazgo necesita gravedad, encabezado y texto."

#: apps/reporting/models.py
msgid "Unknown finding severity."
msgstr "Gravedad de hallazgo desconocida."

#: apps/reporting/views.py
msgid "Draft frozen. You can now write its narrative."
msgstr "Borrador congelado. Ya se puede escribir su narrativa."

#: apps/reporting/views.py
msgid "An approved report is not edited: issue a new revision instead."
msgstr "Un informe aprobado no se edita: emita una revisión nueva."

#: apps/reporting/views.py
msgid "This period already had a report; opening the latest one."
msgstr "Este período ya tenía un informe; se abre el más reciente."

#: templates/reporting/monthly_report.html
msgid "Write the narrative"
msgstr "Escribir la narrativa"

#: templates/reporting/monthly_report.html
msgid "Freeze this period as a draft"
msgstr "Congelar este período como borrador"

#: templates/reporting/narrative_form.html
msgid "Back to the report"
msgstr "Volver al informe"

#: templates/reporting/narrative_form.html
msgid ""
"Findings and the note for the period. The figures come from the database and "
"are not edited here."
msgstr ""
"Hallazgos y observación del período. Las cifras salen de la base de datos y "
"no se editan acá."

#: templates/reporting/narrative_form.html
msgid ""
"A finding is a judgement about the figures, not a query: it is written by "
"whoever signs the report."
msgstr ""
"Un hallazgo es un juicio sobre las cifras, no una consulta: lo escribe quien "
"firma el informe."

#: apps/reporting/models.py
msgid "Only a draft can be approved; issue a new revision instead."
msgstr "Sólo un borrador se puede aprobar: emita una revisión nueva."

#: apps/reporting/views.py
msgid "Report approved. It is now read-only."
msgstr "Informe aprobado. Queda de sólo lectura."

#: templates/reporting/monthly_report.html
msgid ""
"Approving closes the report: it stops being editable and a correction has to "
"be issued as a new revision. Continue?"
msgstr ""
"Aprobar cierra el informe: deja de ser editable y una corrección hay que "
"emitirla como revisión nueva. ¿Continuar?"

